OL,3,GNEWSADuo who abused people at Islamic
OL,4,ACentre jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and woman have been jailed after
OL,7,Fbeing found guilty of abusing people
OL,8,Foutside an Islamic Centre.
OL,10,FThe Royal Court heard Tamara Dubois,
OL,11,F37, and Jade Hamon, 52, acted
OL,12,Faggressively outside the Jersey Islamic
OL,13,FCentre in St Helier during Ramadan in
OL,14,FMarch which included threatening to
OL,15,Finject worshippers with pork - a food
OL,16,Fwhich is forbidden from consumption in
OL,17,Fthe religion.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
