OL,3,GNEWSADuo who abused people at Islamic
OL,4,ACentre jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FDubois was sentenced to 14 months for
OL,7,Fone count of threatening and abusive
OL,8,Fbehaviour and three counts of assault,
OL,9,Fwhile Hamon was given a six-month
OL,10,Fsentence for threatening and abusive
OL,11,Fbehaviour.
OL,13,FThe pair were also jailed for a further
OL,14,Fthree years each for importing heroin
OL,15,Fin separate charges.
